  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> You experience high-energy trauma to your chest, the resulting shearing forces partly detaching your ascending aorta from the heart. Blood immediately starts filling the pericardial sac surrounding your heart, causing what is called a hemopericardium. \n The accumulation of blood prevents your heart from beating effectively, rapidly reducing your cardiac output.</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (2). You also gain @Condition[Fatigued] (1), gaining another level at the end of each of your subsequent turns. When you have reached @Condition[Fatigued] (10) you expire. \n Only magical healing can save you, requiring a spell or prayer equivalent to Surgery** to stop further accumulation of @Condition[Fatigued] Conditions. Ordinary Surgery won’t do any good. If you survive you’ll be able to remove one level of @Condition[Fatigued] Condition every second day.</p>"
    },
